From 3ac1814a36bf49cb3bb22c19ebf475406402c0a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Asif Ikbal <asif.ikbal@amd.com>
Date: Mon, 25 Aug 2025 21:48:08 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 068/190] v4l: xilinx: scd: Add YUV444 12 bpc media bus format

commit 3770164157c54d3ff7b927c0d5ba56e0cee7d43d from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Add media bus format support for YUV444 12 bits per component in
streaming mode.

Signed-off-by: Asif Ikbal <asif.ikbal@amd.com>
Reviewed-by: Vishal Sagar <vishal.sagar@amd.com>
Message-ID: <1756138688-2715580-1-git-send-email-asif.ikbal@amd.com>
State: pending
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 drivers/media/platform/xilinx/xilinx-scenechange-channel.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/xilinx/xilinx-scenechange-channel.c b/drivers/media/platform/xilinx/xilinx-scenechange-channel.c
index 34fcd8205a43..fc166df75c18 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/xilinx/xilinx-scenechange-channel.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/xilinx/xilinx-scenechange-channel.c
@@ -139,6 +139,7 @@ static int xscd_chan_get_vid_fmt(u32 media_bus_fmt, bool memory_based)
 		break;
 	case MEDIA_BUS_FMT_VUY8_1X24:
 	case MEDIA_BUS_FMT_VUY10_1X30:
+	case MEDIA_BUS_FMT_VUY12_1X36:
 		vid_fmt = XSCD_VID_FMT_YUV_444;
 		break;
 	case MEDIA_BUS_FMT_RBG888_1X24:
